        "slc_e145e83158b42f38019f3c5f95b278be86f1f53a68f620ba0e8ca8d75b6f550d"
      ],
      "text": "During GRPO training, an external judge scores each trajectory's final answer against ground truth with binary rewards (1.0 correct, 0.0 failed or hallucinated), and relative advantages are computed against the group mean."
    },
